{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 41,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.188232421875,
        513.4835205078125,
        96.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "Existing diagnostic tests for TB in children have shortcomings, and the full range of tests -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18475341796875,
        513.3798828125,
        112.5362548828125
      ],
      "text": "including bacteriological culture and tuberculin skin testing (TST) - is often unavailable in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.1812744140625,
        513.4720458984375,
        128.53277587890625
      ],
      "text": "settings where the majority of TB cases occur. The development of affordable diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17779541015625,
        513.4144287109375,
        144.529296875
      ],
      "text": "tests for TB in children in low-resource settings should be a priority for researchers and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        147.17431640625,
        155.3043975830078,
        160.52581787109375
      ],
      "text": "policy-makers.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        180.25123596191406,
        130.37139892578125,
        197.10723876953125
      ],
      "text": "3.3\t R",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.5872039794922,
        184.25804138183594,
        342.3611145019531,
        196.05723571777344
      ],
      "text": "ecent improvements in diagnostics",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        204.79998779296875,
        513.4834594726562,
        218.1514892578125
      ],
      "text": "Since the first edition of this guidance was published in 2006, novel approaches to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        220.7965087890625,
        513.4029541015625,
        234.14801025390625
      ],
      "text": "confirmation of TB have been developed and evaluated. These include more rapid",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        236.72402954101562,
        513.448974609375,
        250.14453125
      ],
      "text": "M.  culture techniques and genotypic (molecular) techniques that improve detection of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        252.72055053710938,
        513.4719848632812,
        266.14105224609375
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis . For example, commercially available liquid culture systems and molecular",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        268.7170715332031,
        513.4375610351562,
        282.1375732421875
      ],
      "text": "(6, 7)  line probe assays for rapid detection of MDR-TB have been endorsed by WHO",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        284.7825927734375,
        513.4605712890625,
        298.13409423828125
      ],
      "text": "although their uptake is constrained in resource-limited settings by their cost and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        300.77911376953125,
        139.54940795898438,
        314.130615234375
      ],
      "text": "complexity.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        327.9604187011719,
        165.05538940429688,
        342.180419921875
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        350.70391845703125,
        513.4258422851562,
        364.055419921875
      ],
      "text": "The development that has received most attention recently is that of the Xpert MTB/RIF",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        366.7004089355469,
        513.4603881835938,
        380.0519104003906
      ],
      "text": "assay. This is a fully automated real-time DNA based test which can detect both TB and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        382.6968994140625,
        302.0788879394531,
        396.04840087890625
      ],
      "text": "resistance to rifamipicin in less than 2 hours.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        407.2033996582031,
        513.3798828125,
        420.5549011230469
      ],
      "text": "Following successful clinical evaluation in adults with TB in a variety of settings, WHO",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        423.19989013671875,
        513.4262084960938,
        436.5513916015625
      ],
      "text": "endorsed the Xpert MTB/RIF assay in 2010 and published recommendations in 2011.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        439.1963806152344,
        513.4375610351562,
        452.5478820800781
      ],
      "text": "However, in 2011, published data from children on the performance of Xpert MTB/RIF",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        455.19287109375,
        513.368408203125,
        468.54437255859375
      ],
      "text": "assay were limited and the policy statement of 2011 therefore made no recommendations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        471.1893615722656,
        280.7809143066406,
        484.5408630371094
      ],
      "text": "for its use that were specific to children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        495.69586181640625,
        513.3915405273438,
        509.04736328125
      ],
      "text": "Encouraging data, mainly concerned with sputum samples, are emerging from children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        511.6233215332031,
        513.4834594726562,
        525.0438232421875
      ],
      "text": "(8, 9,  that show an improved yield and sensitivity compared with smear microscopy",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        527.619873046875,
        513.4490356445312,
        541.0403442382812
      ],
      "text": "10, 11) (8)  , although two of these studies also considered nasopharyngeal aspirate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        543.6163940429688,
        513.3799438476562,
        557.036865234375
      ],
      "text": "(9) and gastric lavage  . However, sensitivity of Xpert MTB/RIF is still lower than culture",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        559.6818237304688,
        513.471923828125,
        573.0333251953125
      ],
      "text": "confirmation or clinical diagnosis. More data are needed from children, including",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        575.6783447265625,
        513.4719848632812,
        589.0298461914062
      ],
      "text": "more evaluation of specimens other than sputum, plus operational evaluation of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        591.6748657226562,
        513.4721069335938,
        605.0263671875
      ],
      "text": "role of Xpert MTB/RIF in the diagnostic evaluation of children with suspected TB (see",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        607.6713256835938,
        143.8389129638672,
        621.0228271484375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 9).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        632.1778564453125,
        513.448974609375,
        645.5293579101562
      ],
      "text": "Given the amount of additional data on Xpert MTB/RIF having emerged since 2010,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        648.1743774414062,
        513.4144897460938,
        661.52587890625
      ],
      "text": "an update of the current WHO policy guidance was warranted. WHO therefore",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        664.1708374023438,
        513.4603881835938,
        677.5223388671875
      ],
      "text": "commissioned three systematic reviews to update and revise current policy guidance,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        680.1673583984375,
        513.4490356445312,
        693.5188598632812
      ],
      "text": "including the utility of Xpert MTB/RIF for the diagnosis of tuberculosis and rifampicin",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        696.1638793945312,
        513.4720458984375,
        709.515380859375
      ],
      "text": "resistance in pulmonary, extra-pulmonary and paediatric TB. An updated review of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        712.1603393554688,
        513.40283203125,
        725.5118408203125
      ],
      "text": "published studies on the affordability and cost-effectiveness of Xpert MTB/RIF was also",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        728.1568603515625,
        513.3798828125,
        741.5083618164062
      ],
      "text": "done. In May 2013, WHO convened an Expert Group to evaluate the data and formulate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        744.0844116210938,
        513.4146728515625,
        757.5048828125
      ],
      "text": "(12) recommendations  . The recommendations on the use of Xpert MTB/RIF in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        760.1498413085938,
        513.4259643554688,
        773.5013427734375
      ],
      "text": "were approved by the WHO Guideline Review Committee in October 2013 and no",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        776.1463623046875,
        433.5124816894531,
        789.4978637695312
      ],
      "text": "additional searches for evidence were undertaken since October 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "22",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}